{
  "name": "Wake the Mac, which wakes up locked (SPEC-09 r19, r20, p1)",
  "notes": [
    "The phone knows the Mac's wake addresses from an earlier toolList, and sends the Wake-on-LAN packet on the local Wi-Fi, outside the bridge.",
    "The Mac reconnects and sends its toolList, so the phone sends the queued goal.",
    "The screen is locked, so the Mac answers waitingForUnlock and the phone says the Other device locked copy. Yumi never types the password.",
    "The user unlocks the Mac, and the goal starts by itself."
